/** @defgroup stream_adapters_api stream adapters API
 *  @ingroup stream_api
 *
 *  @brief Adapter-facing API for the `stream` port.
 *
 *  @details
 *  This API exposes the contracts used to implement concrete `stream`
 *  adapters and bind backend operations to public stream handles.
 *
 *  It provides:
 *  - the adapter-side constructor helper,
 *  - adapter environment types,
 *  - adapter descriptor types,
 *  - backend operation callbacks and dispatch table types.
 *
 *  Main headers:
 *  - `stream_adapters_api.h`
 *  - `stream_adapters_types.h`
 *  - `stream_adapters_vtbl.h`
 */
